text = "Humanity once had a future.
Then came the pollution.
Year after year, the world was pushed further toward collapse. Forests disappeared. The air darkened. The planet ran out of time.
But time can be changed.
The Keeper has been given one final chance:
Collect the lost seconds.
Every second recovered pushes the world further back toward the moment before it was too late.
But there is only so much time left.
Catch enough. Restore the future."
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

