[node name="Label" type="Label" parent="How to play" unique_id=1852174212]
offset_left = 110.0
offset_top = 90.0
offset_right = 1060.0
offset_bottom = 633.0
text = " MOVEMENT:
W / A / D:- Move and jump.
SPACE — Wall Jump
Press SPACE while touching a wall to leap away from it.
S — Roll : Press S while in the air to perform a roll.
But beware; as time passes you grow older, losing some of your agility.

TIME ABILITIES
You have 3 charges for your time abilities. Upon usage you lose 1 charge; but this can be regained after some time passes. You may unlcok the time bubble ability as you continue playing
E — TIME BUBBLE
Summon a bubble that affects the flow of time around you.
But be careful...
Sometimes the bubble backfires. Not every bubble will work in your favor, so use your charges wisely.
Q - Time Dash: Dash forward in time to the nearest fragment

 RECLAIM TIME
Catch falling Time Fragments to gain seconds.Miss them, and time is lost.
The more seconds you recover, the further the world can be restored. Keep going until you have reclaimed enough time to return the world to a pollution-free state.
THE FUTURE IS IN YOUR HANDS.
"
autowrap_mode = 3

